  "description": "Big on features. Big on jumps.\n\nThe DK Six Pack got its name at the trails but feels right at home at the park or in the streets. The 4130 heat-treated chromoly main frame is pro-inspired with excellent geometry, upgraded with a strong double-walled wheelset, 100% sealed bearings throughout, and a chromoly crankset with a 26T aluminum sprocket delivering the durability you need for every session. The DK Six Pack is top-tier performance at a price that won't break the bank.\n\nCranks Wise tubular chromoly 3-piece, 170mm, 8-spline spindle\n\nSprocket DK Replica 26-tooth, alloy\n\nChain KMC Z-510\n\nPedals DK Blender PC platform\n\nRims Wise Rectrix2, Double wall, 36mm wide, 36-hole\n\nFront Hub Alloy, sealed, 3/8” axle\n\nRear Hub Alloy, sealed, 14mm axle, 9-tooth driver\n\nTires Kenda 20x2.3”, 60psi\n\nSeat DK 1-piece padded seat/post combo\n\nSeat Post Integrated, 25.4mm, alloy\n\nExtra Features 3D head tube badge\n\nSeat Post Clamp Integrated\n\nWeight 25.4 lbs",
